차용은 구조와 상태 원리만 사용했다. 타사 logo, illustration, copy는 사용하지 않았다.

## 유지한 기존 기능

- route25/sidebar26, current inline SVG icons, semantic light/dark tokens, ThemeToggle/FOUC
- public/customer/operator shell, Settings 8/9 role fidelity
- provider-specific account connect/status/manage, multiple account selection and individual publish truth
- Studio existing9, visual7/direct4/text8/video3 truth, longform to clipper to wiki refine handoff
- current per-card edit/publish, bulk publish, single/bulk schedule, Inbox, Calendar, result, retry/reconcile/repair semantics
- Images, Videos, Blog, Search Console, Keyword routes and owner boundaries
- OSMU/OSMU 팩토리 naming

## 추가한 것

- `/` additive Command Center modules: fact1, opportunity1, Weekly Plan1, loop progress, result/metric/experiment
- owner-route deep-links instead of replacement tabs
- per-post Review truth panel and approval invalidation copy
- publication proof, native metric/sample-hold, evidence insight, one-variable experiment, next-plan closure
- 390 visible Menu trigger and 26-destination drawer target

